    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Please try:<div><br><div>注意: 本範例之安裝目錄皆在 C:\\  根目錄, 如果目錄含有空白字元等, 則執行可能會有問題, 安裝目錄如下:</div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>C:\\R\\R-3.0.1<br></b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>C:\\Rtools</b></font><br></div><div><br></div><div><b style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\"># title: compile the package</b><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># date: 2013.8.30</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" color=\"#0000ff\"><b># step 1.</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># download and install &quot;Rtools&quot; to &quot;C:\\Rtools&quot; directory</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># <a href=\"http://cran.cs.pu.edu.tw/bin/windows/Rtools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.cs.pu.edu.tw/bin/windows/Rtools/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238783132000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0t9Oxjmz8jZ3EypTazMRug\">http://cran.cs.pu.edu.tw/bin/windows/Rtools/</a></b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" color=\"#0000ff\"><b># step 2.</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># download the souce file to working dirctory</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/Rcmdr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/Rcmdr/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238783132000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Xm2Oe5122L71nvpki7_u1\">http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/Rcmdr/</a></b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># e.g. &quot;Rcmdr_1.9-6.tar.gz&quot;</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" color=\"#0000ff\"><b># step 3.</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># compile the source file to package</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" color=\"#ff0000\"><b>install.packages(&quot;Rcmdr_1.9-6.tar.gz&quot;, repos = NULL, type=&quot;source&quot;)</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># ...</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># installing to C:/R/R-3.0.1/library/Rcmdr/libs/x64</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># ** R</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># ** inst</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># ** byte-compile and prepare package for lazy loading</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># ** help</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># *** installing help indices</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># ** building package indices</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># ** installing vignettes</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># ** testing if installed package can be loaded</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># *** arch - i386</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># </b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># Welcome at Fri Aug 30 23:18:31 2013 </b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># *** arch - x64</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># </b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># Welcome at Fri Aug 30 23:18:32 2013 </b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># * DONE (Rcmdr)</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" color=\"#0000ff\"><b># step 4.</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># load library and quit Rcmdr, updated to 1.9-6 verison</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" color=\"#ff0000\"><b>&gt;library(Rcmdr)</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" color=\"#ff0000\"><b><br></b></font></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KXOlk0gsYdU/UiC8TRgRZEI/AAAAAAAAAeg/Tmye-iKmUOA/s1600/Rcmdr-1.9.6.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KXOlk0gsYdU/UiC8TRgRZEI/AAAAAAAAAeg/Tmye-iKmUOA/s1600/Rcmdr-1.9.6.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238783132000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wVaS9Wmk5iWhHyWwvBxyP\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KXOlk0gsYdU/UiC8TRgRZEI/AAAAAAAAAeg/Tmye-iKmUOA/s320/Rcmdr-1.9.6.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"149\"></a></p><div># end</div><div><br></div>Hen-Chao Chang於 2013年8月30日星期五UTC+8下午10時36分41秒寫道：</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
